    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f Chaotic Party Arr-cade Action for up to 12 players \ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Join two rival crews of up to 6 mates as you battle for supremacy on the high seas. Play locally or online, where teams try to steal treasure, defeat enemy captains, or sink ships to win matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/9889c2d03760b5c2434e28d163f9095b.webp?t=1741477320\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/b997d95dc4cb0874804eee880cad1660.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/b997d95dc4cb0874804eee880cad1660.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/b997d95dc4cb0874804eee880cad1660.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by classic SNES games and modern couch co-op games, Plunder Panic blends retro graphics, arcade action, team-based strategy, and a boatload of  modify-arrs to keep even the crankiest pirates happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/3dfaa0fce2a466f03733263094764dc9.webp?t=1741477320\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/38ec15d3ca34aa844f71e761abd9a719.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/38ec15d3ca34aa844f71e761abd9a719.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/38ec15d3ca34aa844f71e761abd9a719.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Plunder Panic supports flexible team configurations with local, online, and AI-controlled players, making it perfect for casual parties and competitive play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/544961192b2a96f8e3e9b4372c73123e.webp?t=1741477320\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/b9d5a59d135f53614a6ea8f45c9f278c.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/b9d5a59d135f53614a6ea8f45c9f278c.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/b9d5a59d135f53614a6ea8f45c9f278c.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the treacherous, pirate-infested waters in campaign mode! Complete unique objectives across each island, unlocking new items, levels, and modify-arrs along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/65b24201a147a81ee353104382f06e56.webp?t=1741477320\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/6d5be5ba15f4c41dc7fb37373090747a.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/6d5be5ba15f4c41dc7fb37373090747a.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/6d5be5ba15f4c41dc7fb37373090747a.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring 18 unique stages, each with dynamic, gameplay-altering effects! Dodge axe-throwing shopkeepers, spear-shooting Vikings, and even a ship-snapping kraken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/2a6f4d7998e94eb27801d4edef04dba0.webp?t=1741477320\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/052ffee93ca121baf1fe767071bb0f90.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/052ffee93ca121baf1fe767071bb0f90.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/052ffee93ca121baf1fe767071bb0f90.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/4b443de105bbefd023f46b7e3b0aa6fd.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/4b443de105bbefd023f46b7e3b0aa6fd.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/4b443de105bbefd023f46b7e3b0aa6fd.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/260d3b824442c943df61fed99e25e719.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/260d3b824442c943df61fed99e25e719.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/260d3b824442c943df61fed99e25e719.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to add more panic? We have boatloads of game modes, items, and modify-arrs to play with. There are endless combinations to explore on our high seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/678bc6821842e6d8052c990c16da2dc6.webp?t=1741477320\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/6ba471c80e7238fca3106010a745f1ff.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/6ba471c80e7238fca3106010a745f1ff.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/6ba471c80e7238fca3106010a745f1ff.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/60b64256931381caa442e1c7d47deead.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/60b64256931381caa442e1c7d47deead.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/60b64256931381caa442e1c7d47deead.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have a crew on another platform? No problem! Plunder Panic features\u00a0<strong>crossplay</strong>\u00a0support across 10+ platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/699990a75695e8c12be87eaa9f6dacc2.webp?t=1741477320\" /></div>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/0f0db33bca684db1b8961763228c131f.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/0f0db33bca684db1b8961763228c131f.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/0f0db33bca684db1b8961763228c131f.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aspire to be the top pirate in the world? Swashbuckle the competition in ranked online matches! Or prefer to conquer yer couch? Retro-inspired player awards and stats keep you earning plunder to increase your sharable bounty poster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/bb196f17e7c817b181c50fb9fb5809d3.webp?t=1741477320\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our coffers are starting to grow with indie acclaim!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">IndieCade Audience Choice Award, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PAX Rising Showcase winner, Official selection of the Indie MEGABOOTH </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featured at SXSW, PAX East, PAX West, and PAX Rising Online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not sold yet, ye scurvy dog?</strong>\u00a0Our <strong>FREE DEMO\u00a0</strong>offers online matches (including crossplay) and the first 10 levels of the campaign.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble yer crew, get all hands on deck, and send the scurvy competition to Davy Jones\u2019 Locker in Plunder Panic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f Chaotic Party Arr-cade Action for up to 12 players \ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Join two rival crews of up to 6 mates as you battle for supremacy on the high seas. Play locally or online, where teams try to steal treasure, defeat enemy captains, or sink ships to win matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/9889c2d03760b5c2434e28d163f9095b.webp?t=1741477320\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/b997d95dc4cb0874804eee880cad1660.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/b997d95dc4cb0874804eee880cad1660.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/b997d95dc4cb0874804eee880cad1660.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by classic SNES games and modern couch co-op games, Plunder Panic blends retro graphics, arcade action, team-based strategy, and a boatload of  modify-arrs to keep even the crankiest pirates happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/3dfaa0fce2a466f03733263094764dc9.webp?t=1741477320\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/38ec15d3ca34aa844f71e761abd9a719.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/38ec15d3ca34aa844f71e761abd9a719.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/38ec15d3ca34aa844f71e761abd9a719.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Plunder Panic supports flexible team configurations with local, online, and AI-controlled players, making it perfect for casual parties and competitive play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/544961192b2a96f8e3e9b4372c73123e.webp?t=1741477320\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/b9d5a59d135f53614a6ea8f45c9f278c.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/b9d5a59d135f53614a6ea8f45c9f278c.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/b9d5a59d135f53614a6ea8f45c9f278c.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the treacherous, pirate-infested waters in campaign mode! Complete unique objectives across each island, unlocking new items, levels, and modify-arrs along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/65b24201a147a81ee353104382f06e56.webp?t=1741477320\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/6d5be5ba15f4c41dc7fb37373090747a.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/6d5be5ba15f4c41dc7fb37373090747a.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/6d5be5ba15f4c41dc7fb37373090747a.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring 18 unique stages, each with dynamic, gameplay-altering effects! Dodge axe-throwing shopkeepers, spear-shooting Vikings, and even a ship-snapping kraken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/2a6f4d7998e94eb27801d4edef04dba0.webp?t=1741477320\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/052ffee93ca121baf1fe767071bb0f90.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/052ffee93ca121baf1fe767071bb0f90.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/052ffee93ca121baf1fe767071bb0f90.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/4b443de105bbefd023f46b7e3b0aa6fd.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/4b443de105bbefd023f46b7e3b0aa6fd.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/4b443de105bbefd023f46b7e3b0aa6fd.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/260d3b824442c943df61fed99e25e719.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/260d3b824442c943df61fed99e25e719.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/260d3b824442c943df61fed99e25e719.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to add more panic? We have boatloads of game modes, items, and modify-arrs to play with. There are endless combinations to explore on our high seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/678bc6821842e6d8052c990c16da2dc6.webp?t=1741477320\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/6ba471c80e7238fca3106010a745f1ff.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/6ba471c80e7238fca3106010a745f1ff.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/6ba471c80e7238fca3106010a745f1ff.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/60b64256931381caa442e1c7d47deead.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/60b64256931381caa442e1c7d47deead.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/60b64256931381caa442e1c7d47deead.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have a crew on another platform? No problem! Plunder Panic features\u00a0<strong>crossplay</strong>\u00a0support across 10+ platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/699990a75695e8c12be87eaa9f6dacc2.webp?t=1741477320\" /></div>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/0f0db33bca684db1b8961763228c131f.poster.avif?t=1741477320\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/0f0db33bca684db1b8961763228c131f.webm?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/0f0db33bca684db1b8961763228c131f.mp4?t=1741477320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aspire to be the top pirate in the world? Swashbuckle the competition in ranked online matches! Or prefer to conquer yer couch? Retro-inspired player awards and stats keep you earning plunder to increase your sharable bounty poster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455900/extras/bb196f17e7c817b181c50fb9fb5809d3.webp?t=1741477320\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our coffers are starting to grow with indie acclaim!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">IndieCade Audience Choice Award, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PAX Rising Showcase winner, Official selection of the Indie MEGABOOTH </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featured at SXSW, PAX East, PAX West, and PAX Rising Online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not sold yet, ye scurvy dog?</strong>\u00a0Our <strong>FREE DEMO\u00a0</strong>offers online matches (including crossplay) and the first 10 levels of the campaign.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble yer crew, get all hands on deck, and send the scurvy competition to Davy Jones\u2019 Locker in Plunder Panic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>",
    "short_description": "Chaotic Party Arr-cade Action for up to 12 players! Be the first to plunder all the treasure, sink the enemy ship, or defeat their captain. Featuring local &amp; online play, crossplay, 18 stages, 30+ modify-arrs, and a single-player campaign!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cPlunder Panic has all the right ingredients to succeed both as a party game and a competitive game, as it provides plenty of fun and strategy. This is a labor of love, and it shows.\u201d<br>Save or Quit<br><br>\u201c...one of the most enjoyable experiences we had...\u201d<br>Ars Technica<br>",
